      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=Fs$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据牛顿第二定律",
        "$F=ma$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "另一方面，在第二章中我们曾得知，在匀加速直线运",
        "动时，",
        "$s=\\frac{v_2^2-v_1^2}{2a}$，",
        "式中 $v_1$ 和 $v_2$ 分别是物体在我们所研究的线段上的初速度和",
        "末速度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得出：",
        "$A=ma\\frac{v_2^2-v_1^2}{2a}=\\frac{mv_2^2}{2}-\\frac{mv_1^2}{2}$.　(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们得到了力 $\\vec{F}$ 的功与物体速度（精确地说是**物体速度**",
        "的平方）的变化之间的关系式，"
      ]
